docs {
  # Reset Password (OTP)

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/auth/password/reset`
  **Auth:** None

  ## Description

  Resets a forgotten password using a verified OTP session. The backend automatically determines the channel from the identifier. Protected by CaptchaGuard when captcha is enabled.

  ## Request

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `X-Captcha-ID` | `string` | Conditional | Captcha challenge ID (required when `CAPTCHA_ENABLED=true`) |
  | `X-Captcha-Code` | `string` | Conditional | Solved captcha answer (required when `CAPTCHA_ENABLED=true`) |

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `identifier` | `string` | Yes | Verified email address or mobile phone number |
  | `new_password` | `string` | Yes | New account password (minimum 6 characters) |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "message": "password reset successfully"
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Missing parameters, password too short, or missing captcha headers
  * `403 Forbidden` — Identifier has not been verified via OTP, or account is deactivated
  * `404 Not Found` — User account not found
}
